CORE
main.cob
--cobol-data-exception-check
^EXIT=10$
^SIGNAL=0$
^\[cobol:numeric\.\d+\].*: FAILURE$
^VERIFICATION FAILED$
--
Opt-in data-exception (S0C7) check: a zoned item with non-digit content used
arithmetically is flagged. IBM LR "Class condition". See
doc/architectural/cobol-runtime-checks.md.
